      "audioSha256": "3c12a5ab16427ec7051d306fa29ca9c4f9b440e8a89b92220739458d10b53f88"
    },
    {
      "index": 387,
      "text": "It was something in between.",
      "audioSha256": "d06c1fa19fab2c7e8efe6a7be2baadd4e23062eaa8f22b0ac305fcd9f5927fbe"
    },
    {
      "index": 393,
      "text": "When you swung a sack off a rail, you dropped your hips and your weight went down and back.",
      "audioSha256": "efead05635451814b1bea4dcf0da3ddb7e428ec4ce5b3bf3998753ea65e425b2"
    },
    {
      "index": 396,
      "text": "The thing was the direction, the moment your weight stopped going up to meet the sack and started going back and down to take it.",
      "audioSha256": "1ebd15dc0f6a48358bc52f942b25dc049a9b362ea79eb8c0aa563ed8f23670ce"
    },
    {
      "index": 399,
      "text": "The rest of you only followed.",
      "audioSha256": "66e85fe72f833adea7034ebd5b436156376ac19de404e72031697af0da65e306"
